OL,3,AScandal-hit Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang
OL,4,Aquits, plunging AI chipmaking giant
OL,5,Ainto turmoil
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has abruptly quit as chief
OL,8,Fexecutive of AI chipmaking giant Nvidia
OL,9,Fafter revelations of alleged
OL,10,Fextramarital affairs, in a stunning
OL,11,Ffall from grace that sent shockwaves
OL,12,Ffrom Silicon Valley to Capitol Hill.
OL,14,FNvidia is now under scrutiny from US
OL,15,Flawmakers in Washington DC demanding
OL,16,FHuang answer questions over whether one
OL,17,Fof his alleged relationships was with a
OL,18,FChinese spy.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
