OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AScandal-hit Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang
OL,4,Aquits, plunging AI chipmaking giant
OL,5,Ainto turmoil
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the world's most valuable
OL,8,Fcompanies as a result of the AI boom,
OL,9,FNvidia has lost $550bn (#415bn) in
OL,10,Fstock market value in just five days as
OL,11,Fthe scandal dominated headlines.
OL,13,FNvidia's interim CEO, Colette Kress,
OL,14,Fcalled an emergency meeting of her
OL,15,Fexecutive team to discuss the company's
OL,16,Ffuture.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
