OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794529463
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AThe rise and fall of Jensen Huang - how
OL,4,Athe tech superstar became mired in
OL,5,Ascandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday, he resigned following
OL,8,Fback-to-back revelations of two
OL,9,Faffairs. News of the first - a
OL,10,Frelationship with a businesswoman
OL,11,Falleged to be a Chinese spy -
OL,12,Fricocheted around the world, raising
OL,13,Feyebrows among investors. It was
OL,14,Ffollowed on Wednesday by reports that
OL,15,Fthe tech boss had also had an affair
OL,16,Fwith an Nvidia colleague.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/19
