OL,3,ASchools, libraries and parents face
OL,4,A'difficult decision' over David
OL,5,AWalliams books
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome schools have removed David
OL,8,FWalliams books from their libraries
OL,9,Ffollowing the publication of
OL,10,Fallegations against the best-selling
OL,11,Fchildren's author and comedian.
OL,13,F"Head teachers are already making
OL,14,Fdifficult decisions about whether or
OL,15,Fnot these books should remain on the
OL,16,Fbookshelves of libraries at the
OL,17,Fmoment," said Pepe Di'Iasio, general
OL,18,Fsecretary of the Association of School
OL,19,Fand College Leaders.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
