CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794529463
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASchools, libraries and parents face
OL,4,A'difficult decision' over David
OL,5,AWalliams books
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'm aware from several of our members
OL,8,Fthat they've already taken the decision
OL,9,Fto take them off their shelves."
OL,11,FWalliams sold more than 50 million
OL,12,Fcopies of books including Gangsta
OL,13,FGranny and Billionaire Boy. He has
OL,14,Fdenied allegations of sexual misconduct
OL,15,Fand abuses of power.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
